00:10:33.908 --> 00:10:35.020
The CLI

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:38.391
lolly runs any tool from the terminal

00:10:38.489 --> 00:10:41.048
through the same engine and the same

00:10:41.108 --> 00:10:44.713
