00:15:16.853 --> 00:15:19.267
Licensing & structure

00:15:19.975 --> 00:15:31.550
Every unit now lives in its own repo under github-com/lolly-tools, pinned as a submodule of this umbrella «see Repository layout».

00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:36.800
Code - engine/, shells/, services/, docs/

00:15:36.833 --> 00:15:39.644
- is MPL-2 point 0.

00:15:40.025 --> 00:15:43.975
Tool content ships as brand packs.

00:15:44.325 --> 00:16:02.275
community/ «public lolly-tools» holds the brand-agnostic tools; brands/suse/ «private suse-lolly» holds the SUSE tools and catalog - including its licensed PremiumBeat music, which stays private with the pack.

00:16:02.625 --> 00:16:13.375
The repo-root tools/ and catalog/ are gitignored profile views assembled from those packs; see each pack's NOTICE-md.

00:16:13.725 --> 00:16:31.500
Fonts ship inside each brand pack under the SIL Open Font License 1 point 1 - the SUSE pack carries the SUSE and SUSE Mono typefaces «neither the MPL nor SUSE-proprietary; "SUSE" is a SUSE trademark».

00:16:31.850 --> 00:16:37.675
They appear at catalog/fonts/ in a built profile view.

00:16:38.417 --> 00:16:41.113
Bundled third-party attributions are

00:16:41.175 --> 00:16:44.569
listed in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES-md.
